---
---

<section id="layanan" class="section has-bottom-glow">
  <div class="section-bottom-glow section-bottom-glow-indigo section-bottom-glow-right" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <div class="section-label">Layanan</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Semua yang Dibutuhkan Bisnis Anda</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Dari website sederhana hingga sistem otomasi kompleks, kami handle semuanya.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-title">Website Profesional</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">Landing page, company profile, toko online, hingga web app custom yang cepat, aman, dan mudah dikelola.</p>
        <ul class="service-list">
          <li>Desain modern dan responsif</li>
          <li>SEO-ready dari awal</li>
          <li>CMS yang mudah dipakai</li>
          <li>Hosting dan domain setup</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#kontak" class="service-link">Pelajari lebih lanjut &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card service-card-featured reveal">
        <div class="service-badge">Paling Diminati</div>
        <div class="service-icon service-icon-accent">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/>
            <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/>
            <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-title">Otomasi n8n</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">Hubungkan aplikasi bisnis Anda: WhatsApp, Google Sheets, email, marketplace, dan biarkan sistem bekerja otomatis.</p>
        <ul class="service-list">
          <li>Integrasi 400+ aplikasi</li>
          <li>Notif otomatis WhatsApp</li>
          <li>Sinkronisasi data real-time</li>
          <li>Setup dan training included</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#kontak" class="service-link">Pelajari lebih lanjut &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
            <path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M4.22 4.22l2.12 2.12M17.66 17.66l2.12 2.12M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.22 19.78l2.12-2.12M17.66 6.34l2.12-2.12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-title">Integrasi AI</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">Tambahkan kecerdasan buatan ke bisnis Anda: chatbot AI, analisis data otomatis, dan fitur cerdas lainnya.</p>
        <ul class="service-list">
          <li>Chatbot AI untuk website</li>
          <li>Analisis sentimen ulasan</li>
          <li>Rekomendasi produk otomatis</li>
          <li>Custom AI pipeline</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#kontak" class="service-link">Pelajari lebih lanjut &rarr;</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.services-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
}
@media (max-width: 900px) { .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.service-card {
  background: var(--color-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  transition: box-shadow 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}
.service-card:hover {
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  border-color: var(--color-border-strong);
}

.service-card-featured {
  border-color: var(--color-primary-100);
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--color-primary-50) 0%, var(--color-surface) 60%);
}

.service-badge {
  position: absolute;
  top: -12px;
  left: 24px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  background: var(--color-primary-800);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
}

.service-icon {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--color-surface-muted);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  color: var(--color-primary-800);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
}
.service-icon-accent {
  background: var(--color-accent-50);
  color: var(--color-accent-600);
  border-color: var(--color-accent-200);
}

.service-title {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.service-desc {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.service-list {
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
  flex: 1;
}
.service-list li {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  padding-left: 18px;
  position: relative;
}
.service-list li::before {
  content: '\2713';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  color: var(--color-accent-500);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.service-link {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-primary-800);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color 150ms;
}
.service-link:hover { color: var(--color-primary-600); }
</style>
